[agent] ## Feature engineering (no leakage)
[agent] Per-card, point-in-time features using only prior rows (shift/cumulative/`searchsorted`): transaction velocity (`cnt_1h`, `cnt_24h`, `time_since_prev`), geo signals (haversine `geo_dist` from previous location, implied `speed`), amount signals (`amt_vs_mean` vs the card's expanding mean, `log_amount`), and time-of-day (`hour`, `is_night`, `dayofweek`) plus category/merchant codes.
